Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:04.80,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Your week is a mess because you have no system - here's the 5-minute fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:09.16,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}The 2-2-2 rule: the cheapest way to get a calmer week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:14.16,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Two hours a week for yourself. No work, no phone. Boring is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:19.16,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Two hours for one person who matters to you. Coffee, walk, call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:24.16,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Two hours for future you - one small thing that makes next week easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:28.73,Big,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}That's 6 hours out of 168. You can afford it, even broke.